Franka LABS episode replay distribution

This package contains selected service code and configurations derived from
Franka Robotics LABS (https://github.com/frankarobotics/labs), source base
8e3cb513de407a4d265e4e1a79133d56b3a7ffd9, with local replay and CPU camera changes.
The upstream LABS Apache-2.0 license is provided in LICENSE.

The live scene overlay is adapted from the local_live_overlay.py tool used
in the Camelo EBIM workspace (Apache-2.0) on 2026-09-10.

Vendored service dependencies retain their own LICENSE/NOTICE files:
- franka_follower_controllers: e039b3ac30437ed0d772133810e68d27140b20a1
  https://github.com/frankarobotics/franka_follower_controllers
- gello_software (Robotiq service): b6d977dc09c6d6d8b080cb04aface1260d30db48
  https://github.com/wuphilipp/gello_software

Docker builds obtain additional dependencies under their respective licenses,
including ROS, franka_ros2/libfranka, ros2_robotiq_gripper and zed-open-capture.
This distribution does not change those licenses or confer trademark rights.
